    <text class="terminal-339817453-r2" x="12.2" y="20" textLength="73.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-0)">exomem</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r3" x="85.4" y="20" textLength="134.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-0)">&#160;&#160;First&#160;run</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r4" x="732" y="20" textLength="231.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-0)">no&#160;vault&#160;configured</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-0)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-1)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="24.4" y="68.8" textLength="805.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-2)">Setup&#160;is&#160;a&#160;short&#160;conversation.&#160;Every&#160;answer&#160;becomes&#160;a&#160;line&#160;you&#160;can</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-2)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="24.4" y="93.2" textLength="890.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-3)">read&#160;back;&#160;esc&#160;rewinds&#160;one&#160;line.&#160;Nothing&#160;is&#160;written&#160;until&#160;a&#160;line&#160;says&#160;so.</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-3)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-4)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r6" x="24.4" y="142" textLength="109.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-5)">vault&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="134.2" y="142" textLength="378.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-5)">&#160;Where&#160;should&#160;your&#160;memory&#160;live?</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-5)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-6)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r6" x="0" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-7)">▌</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r7" x="24.4" y="190.8" textLength="390.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-7)">Create&#160;a&#160;fresh&#160;vault&#160;at&#160;~/Exomem</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-7)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r6" x="0" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-8)">▌</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r2" x="48.8" y="215.2" textLength="646.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-8)">a&#160;new&#160;folder,&#160;28&#160;files;&#160;nothing&#160;outside&#160;it&#160;is&#160;touched</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-8)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="24.4" y="239.6" textLength="256.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-9)">Use&#160;an&#160;existing&#160;vault</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-9)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r3" x="48.8" y="264" textLength="671" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-10)">connect&#160;to&#160;a&#160;folder&#160;that&#160;already&#160;holds&#160;a&#160;Knowledge&#160;Base</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-10)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="24.4" y="288.4" textLength="231.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-11)">Scan&#160;a&#160;folder&#160;first</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-11)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r3" x="48.8" y="312.8" textLength="549" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-12)">a&#160;read-only&#160;report&#160;before&#160;you&#160;decide&#160;anything</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-12)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r5" x="24.4" y="337.2" textLength="146.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-13)">Skip&#160;for&#160;now</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-13)">
</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r3" x="48.8" y="361.6" textLength="439.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-14)">everything&#160;stays&#160;reachable&#160;from&#160;Home</text><text class="terminal-339817453-r1" x="976" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-339817453-line-14)">
